# Normalise line endings. The repo is authored on Windows but must check out byte-identically
# everywhere, and the POSIX-sh hooks under hooks/ must stay LF or they fail to exec on the Linux/macOS
# CI runner ("bad interpreter"). `text=auto eol=lf` stores every text file as LF in the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Be explicit for the file kinds this repo actually contains.
*.rs    text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.hbs   text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
hooks/* text eol=lf

# Anything Git detects as binary must never be line-ending-converted.
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.zip   binary
*.rar   binary
